dnl Watchcat Configuration File
dnl
dnl Configure watchcat reactions to IO port changes here.
dnl
dnl Syntax: ECMDTCP(port, edge, ip, command)
dnl   port:   Port and pin (e.g., PA0, PB3)
dnl   edge:   RISING or FALLING
dnl   ip:     IP address to send command to
dnl   command: Command string to send via ecmd_sender_send_command
dnl
dnl Example: Send "io set 254-0" to 192.168.178.10 on PA0 rising and falling
dnl
dnl Every line starting with dnl is a comment.
dnl

ECMDTCP(PA0, RISING, 192.168.178.10, io set 254-0)
ECMDTCP(PA0, FALLING, 192.168.178.10, io set 254-0)
